; colsum_col_out_of_range: a column at the grid extent must raise.
;
; COLSUM had no fault coverage in either implementation's own suite or in
; the vectors, on either identity. The grid is 3x1, so the only valid
; column is 0 and column 1 addresses no line of it.
;
; Not square, for the same reason as rowsum_row_out_of_range: this is the
; case that catches the axis extent being supplied from the wrong side.

PUSH 3
BQMX r0

PUSH 3           ; rows
PUSH 1           ; cols
RESIZE r0

PUSH 1           ; col == cols
COLSUM r0
HALT
